https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds an option to the viewport to generate mipmaps after rendering. This is useful with a SubViewport when using the ViewportTexture as a texture in 3d, since mipmaps can be utilized.\r\n\r\nThe gdscript member `use_mipmaps` is added to the Viewport class. The gdscript method `viewport_set_use_mipmaps` is also added to the RenderingServer. The feature can be used by adding a SubViewport  and toggling on Use Mipmaps.\r\n\r\nThe option is turned off by default. All rendering functionality is identical to before if the option is left off.\r\n\r\nRelated:\r\ngodotengine/godot-proposals#7576\r\n#23417 (although it specifies 3.x)\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: godotengine/godot-proposals#7576*","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076/reactions","total_count":20,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110076/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}